">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.12（875件）</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-red-50 text-red-700 font-bold text-xs rounded-full border border-red-200\">目安 ¥8,650〜</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/54567/54567.jpg\" alt=\"指宿温泉　指宿こころの宿\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡【指宿こころの宿】湯・食・美と癒しの新スポット!!</p>\n      <p><strong>【所在地・エリア】</strong> 📍 鹿児島県指宿市東方9227-6</p>\n      <p><strong>【交通アクセス】</strong> 🚃 ＪＲ　指宿駅より車で１０分（５名様以上のご利用の場合は送迎有り）　</p>\n      <p><strong>【指宿温泉　指宿こころの宿の魅力】</strong> 館内の清潔感と丁寧なサービスに定評があり、鹿児島県周辺の「霧島神宮」巡りとあわせた1泊2日プランに重宝します。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F54567%2F54567.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs md:text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n      ✈️ 指宿温泉　指宿こころの宿 の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る（楽天トラベル公式）\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">秋の指宿温泉旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n  <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</